    "text": "Which of the following lines correctly show the temperature dependence of equilibrium constant K, for an exothermic reaction?<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ltmshjjggxrphqzxoalrahvderjhhexqoxoumfjpfiakbkjpuu.jpeg\" />",
